an ignore it. Never share your sign-in link or verification code.<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">A life of their own. A story you get to follow.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "mailer_subjects_magic_link": "Your sign-in link · Unwatched",
